{
  "title": "Yona Friedman",
  "body": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 53.5pt; tab-stops: 0in;\">Yona Friedman (born 5 June 1923,<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Budapest\">Budapest</a>) is a <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hungary\">Hungarian</a>-born <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_people\">French</a> architect, urban planner and designer. He became famous in the late 1950s and early 1960s, in the so-called age of <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Megastructures_(architecture)\">megastructures</a>.</p>",
